ite.go:34` `ErrNothingToCommit`).\n- **S6** `reviewfix.mergeIncludes` (`loop.go:384-394`): also require the second parent on main's first-parent history.\n- **S7** Tests: undeclared path differs from main → refused; protected path differs (brought in or reverted) → refused; branch `.gitattributes` `merge=union`/`conflict-marker-size` has no effect; whitespace-only resolution + stale human approval → not covered.\n\nBot-commit audit: no new exposure. Keep the merge commit message controller-built (CodeMessage + `Ard-Job`), with no agent or main text.\n\n\n.ard:\n138\n142\n157\n158\n159\n160\n161\n165\n168\n174\n178\n184\n194\n203\n204\n205\n212\n213\n215\n216\n217\n221\n222\n223\n224\n227\n231\n236\n237\n238\n239\n241\n243\n244\n247\n252\n254\n255\n267\n268\n276\n292\n293\n297\n298\n299\n300\n302\n304\n305\n306\n307\n312\n313\n314\n322\n323\n332\n333\n334\n335\n336\n337\n338\n339\n40\n41\n42\n43\n44\n45\n47\n48\n49\n50\n51\n52\n56\n58\n59\n61\n89\nconfig.yaml\nreviewers\nscanners\ntriage\nworkers\n\n.ard/323:\ncosts\nlogs\nplan.md\ntriage-lead.md\nCLAUDE.md\nDockerfile\nLICENSE\nMakefile\nREADME.md\ncmd\ndeploy\ndocs\ngo.mod\ngo.sum\ninternal\nmkdocs.yml","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017S9MhteRfBF8SteQzDU8q4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
